<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Mr. McBee Story Hour - Video Frame Sequence</title>
<script>
window.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] } };
</script>
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js" async></script>
<style>
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    background: #333;
    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
  }
  .video-stack {
    max-width: 540px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    background: #000;
  }
  .frame {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #111;
  }
  .placeholder {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: #eee;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-style: italic;
    text-align: center;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #cbb89a, #a8896b);
  }

  /* Frame 1 */
  .frame1 { height: 300px; }
  .frame1 .placeholder { background: linear-gradient(120deg, #ede6d3 40%, #b9a6ad 40%); }
  .chinese-box {
    position: absolute;
    top: 78px;
    left: 232px;
    background: rgba(0,0,0,0.75);
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: bold;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    border: 1px solid #fff;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
  }
  .handle {
    position: absolute;
    width: 10px;
    height: 10px;
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid #000;
  }
  .handle.tl { top: 73px; left: 202px; }
  .handle.br { top: 143px; left: 460px; }

  .caption {
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    background: rgba(0,0,0,0.75);
    color: #fff;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 8px 6px;
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 500;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
  }
  .caption.large { font-size: 24px; padding: 12px 6px; }

  .frame1 .caption { bottom: 45px; }

  /* Frame 2 */
  .frame2 { height: 105px; }
  .frame2 .placeholder { background: linear-gradient(100deg, #b98a6a 30%, #d8cdb8 30%); }
  .frame2 .caption { bottom: 25px; }

  /* Frame 3 */
  .frame3 { height: 105px; }
  .frame3 .placeholder { background: linear-gradient(100deg, #c9a074 20%, #e8dcc4 70%); }
  .frame3 .caption { top: 40px; }

  /* Frame 4 */
  .frame4 { height: 95px; }
  .frame4 .placeholder { background: linear-gradient(100deg, #d9b98c 10%, #c79a6e 90%); }
  .frame4 .caption { top: 35px; font-size: 15px; padding: 7px 6px; }

  /* Frame 5 */
  .frame5 { height: 105px; }
  .frame5 .placeholder { background: linear-gradient(100deg, #6b5c4a 30%, #b0a89a 70%); }
  .frame5 .caption { bottom: 22px; font-size: 14px; padding: 6px 6px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="video-stack">

  <!-- Frame 1 -->
  <div class="frame frame1">
    <div class="placeholder">[Illustration: man in tweed jacket and bow tie, standing indoors near a wall]</div>
    <div class="chinese-box">故事都非常好</div>
    <div class="handle tl"></div>
    <div class="handle br"></div>
    <div class="caption">"Well, no," said Mr. McBee. "Not really."</div>
  </div>

  <!-- Frame 2 -->
  <div class="frame frame2">
    <div class="placeholder">[Illustration: hand holding open book, "Library Lion" cover visible]</div>
    <div class="caption">"But there's a lion!" said Mr. McBee. "In the library!"</div>
  </div>

  <!-- Frame 3 -->
  <div class="frame frame3">
    <div class="placeholder">[Illustration: close-up of card catalog drawer being sniffed]</div>
    <div class="caption large">He sniffed the card catalog.</div>
  </div>

  <!-- Frame 4 -->
  <div class="frame frame4">
    <div class="placeholder">[Illustration: close-up profile, hair and shoulder visible]</div>
    <div class="caption">There weren't any rules about lions at story hour, either.</div>
  </div>

  <!-- Frame 5 -->
  <div class="frame frame5">
    <div class="placeholder">[Illustration: person's back, holding "Library Lion" book, patterned sweater]</div>
    <div class="caption">He waited for another story, but the children began to walk away.</div>
  </div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
